---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<div class="container">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="about-image">
      <img src="/public/headshot.jpg" alt="Dominic Critchlow" />
    </div>
    <p>Dominic Critchlow is an artificial intelligence practitioner and technology leader focused on how organizations build, deploy, and operationalize AI systems. He currently works in forward-deployed AI, building products for enterprise users.</p>
    <p>Previously, Dominic spent nearly a decade working at the intersection of technology and national security. At the Department of Defense’s Chief Digital and Artificial Intelligence Office, he co-founded Gamechanger, an AI-powered platform that grew from an early prototype into an enterprise capability used across the department. He later led a 60-person engineering organization supporting U.S. European Command and U.S. Africa Command.</p>
    <p>Critchlow also teaches graduate analytics at Seton Hall University and serves as a Military Intelligence officer in the U.S. Army Reserve.</p>
    <p>Off hours I make small things for the fun of it: iOS apps, data visualizations, and radio + machine learning experiments. The latest is <a href="/pinned/">Pinned</a>, a native iOS app for saving the places you care about, now on the App Store. I'm also having a lot of fun with <a href="/flags/">Flags</a>, which tracks how often every country comes up in U.S. congressional language.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Latest</h2>
    <ul class="posts-list">
      {%- for item in collections.latest -%}
      <li class="post-item" data-type="{{ item.type }}">
        <div class="post-title">
          {%- if item.type == "project" and item.logo -%}
          <span class="project-logo">{{ item.logo | safe }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if item.type == "project" -%}
          <a href="{{ item.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.title }}</a>
          {%- else -%}
          <a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.title }}</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="post-meta">
          {{ item.type }}
          {%- if item.type == "project" and item.github -%}
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;<a href="{{ item.github }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a>
          {%- endif -%}
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;<time datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ item.date | readableDate }}</time>
        </div>
        {%- if item.description -%}
        <p class="post-description">{{ item.description }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-link">
      <a href="/writing/">All Writing</a> · <a href="/projects/">All Projects</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/gallery/">Photos</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
